Sval: extension JS honours the Workspaces an extension is available in

A tab's host-permission data, activeTab, captures, find and navigation
events ask the policy whether the tab's Workspace is one the extension
is available in, as they ask about its site. In a window whose
Workspace leaves the extension out, the extensions menu leaves it out,
its menu items go and its shortcuts do nothing. An extension's context
menus gain Show in, the Workspaces its pinned button shows in.

